  "step1Day": "8th Dhul Hijjah (8 ذو الحجة)",
  "step1Title": "1. Miqat & Ihram (Miqat & Ihram)",
  "step1Desc": "Ihram is the sacred state from which the Hajj pilgrimage begins.",
  "step1Loc": "Miqat",
  "step1Tasks": "✅ Perform full Ghusl (Sunnah)\n✅ Trim nails and groom accordingly\n✅ Apply perfume (before Ihram)\n✅ Men: Two pieces of white cloth\n✅ Women: Modest clothing (face uncovered)\n✅ 2 Rakats Nafil prayer\n✅ Intention: \"Labaik Hajjan\"\n✅ Begin reciting the Talbiyah\n❌ Do not cut hair or nails\n❌ Hunting/Quarreling prohibited\n❌ Men: No stitched clothes or head covering",

  "step2Day": "8th Dhul Hijjah (8 ذو الحجة)",
  "step2Title": "2. Stay in Mina (Yawm at-Tarwiyah)",
  "step2Desc": "This is the day of preparation — \"يوم التروية\".",
  "step2Loc": "Mina",
  "step2Tasks": "✅ Move to your assigned tent\n✅ Dhuhr prayer (2 Rakats - Qasr)\n✅ Asr prayer (2 Rakats - Qasr)\n✅ Maghrib prayer (3 Rakats)\n✅ Isha prayer (2 Rakats - Qasr)\n✅ Fajr prayer (2 Rakats)\n✅ Frequent Talbiyah & Dhikr\n⚠️ Save your tent number/location\n⚠️ Stay within your group",

  "step3Day": "9th Dhul Hijjah (9 ذو الحجة)",
  "step3Title": "3. Day of Arafah",
  "step3Desc": "👉 \"Hajj is Arafah\" — The core pillar. Depart from Mina after Sunrise.",
  "step3Loc": "Arafah",
  "step3Tasks": "✅ Dhuhr + Asr (Combined & Shortened)\n✅ Stay in the plain of Arafah (Wuquf)\n✅ Sincere Dua with tears\n✅ Repentance for past sins\n✅ Frequent Istighfar & Durood\n⚠️ Must stay until Sunset",

  "step4Day": "9th Night → 10th Dhul Hijjah",
  "step4Title": "4. Muzdalifah Night",
  "step4Desc": "Staying under the stars — a critical step. Depart from Arafah after Sunset.",
  "step4Loc": "Muzdalifah",
  "step4Tasks": "✅ Maghrib + Isha (Combined)\n✅ Overnight stay in the open area\n✅ Collect pebbles (49 to 70 pieces)\n✅ Perform Fajr prayer & Dua\n⚠️ Depart for Mina before Sunrise",

  "step5Day": "10th Dhul Hijjah (10 ذو الحجة)",
  "step5Title": "5. Day of Sacrifice (Yawm an-Nahr)",
  "step5Desc": "The busiest day — 4 major acts to complete.",
  "step5Loc": "Mina",
  "step5Tasks": "🪨 Stone the Great Jamarat (7 pebbles)\n🐐 Complete the Sacrifice (Qurbani)\n✂️ Shave or trim hair (Tahallul)\n👕 Remove Ihram (Release from restrictions)",

  "step6Day": "10th Dhul Hijjah or later",
  "step6Title": "6. Tawaf al-Ifadah",
  "step6Desc": "👉 This is an obligatory pillar — Hajj is incomplete without it.",
  "step6Loc": "Makkah",
  "step6Tasks": "✅ 7 circuits of Tawaf at Kaaba\n✅ 2 Rakats at Maqam Ibrahim\n✅ Complete Sa’i between Safa & Marwa\n✅ Return to Mina for overnight stay",

  "step7Day": "11th–12th Dhul Hijjah",
  "step7Title": "7. Days of Tashreeq",
  "step7Desc": "The days of stoning. Rituals begin after Dhuhr each day.",
  "step7Loc": "Mina",
  "step7Tasks": "✅ Small Jamarat (7 pebbles)\n✅ Middle Jamarat (7 pebbles)\n✅ Great Jamarat (7 pebbles)\n✅ Increased Dhikr & Prayers\n⚠️ Depart Mina before Sunset on the 12th",

  "step8Day": "Before departing Makkah",
  "step8Title": "8. Farewell Tawaf (Tawaf al-Wida)",
  "step8Desc": "Final Departure — A deeply emotional step. This is Wajib (mandatory).",
  "step8Loc": "Makkah",
  "step8Tasks": "✅ 7 circuits of Farewell Tawaf\n✅ Sincere Dua for acceptance\n✅ Farewell bid to the Holy Kaaba"
